Z||000005||Fierobruiser||11-19-2001||09:50 PM||||Is your ground up stuff green? If so you need the $20.00 rebuid kit from Rodney Dickman. Enough for 2 headlights, includes gears,green bumpers and bolts. If you had an 87 or 88 it would be ground up white plastic from the rollers. <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com/</A> <P>------------------<BR>Notchbacks Rule<BR>85GT(show car)<BR>88Coupe (daily driver)<BR>84 Coupe(project car)||||reg||1
